# Cloudflare Workers API

## Worker Details
- **Name:** `na-projectadmin-api`
- **URL:** `https://na-projectadmin-api.adam-fb3.workers.dev/`
- **Account ID:** `fb32e89aeb7dce82f8391f6496ec8b34`
- **R2 Bucket:** `noble-architecture-cdn`

## API Endpoints
| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
|----------|--------|---------|
| `/health` | GET | Health check |
| `/ip` | GET | Client IP address |
| `/projectadmin/auth` | POST | Validate project PIN |
| `/projectadmin/signature` | POST | Store signature record |
| `/projectadmin/signature` | GET | Retrieve signatures |
| `/r2/*` | GET/PUT | Direct R2 access |

## Worker Source Location
`05__CloudflareWorkers/src/`
- `index.js` - Main router, CORS handling
- `handlers/auth.js` - PIN validation, session tokens
- `handlers/signature.js` - Signature storage/retrieval
- `handlers/r2.js` - R2 bucket operations

## Configuration
- `wrangler.toml` - Worker deployment config
- `.dev.vars` - Local dev secrets (git-ignored)
- `CREDENTIALS_BACKUP.txt` - Credentials backup (git-ignored)

## Deployment
```bash
cd 05__CloudflareWorkers
wrangler deploy
```

## Client Integration
Access via `CloudflareIntegration__ApiClient__.js` module.
Worker URL configured in `AppConfiguration__MainAppSettings__.json` under `CloudflareConfig.workerBaseUrl`.
